<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 1in">(1) The undersigned hereby elects to
purchase <U> </U> Warrant Shares of the Company pursuant to the terms of the attached Warrant (only if exercised in full), and tenders
